OL,3,GNEWSARichmond Library moving date
OL,4,Aconfirmed
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichmond Library will move into a new
OL,7,Fpremises in November, North Yorkshire
OL,8,FCouncil has said.
OL,10,FThe library is being relocated from its
OL,11,Fcurrent home in Queens Road to the
OL,12,Fcouncil-owned Mercury House in Station
OL,13,FRoad.
OL,15,FIt was approved despite concerns from
OL,16,Fsome users about accessibility for
OL,17,Folder people and those with mobility
OL,18,Fissues.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
